{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出地持戒品中菩薩戒本經，故今省之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "收于續藏經第六十壹套中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出于在家律要廣集，故今省之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若諸菩薩欲學菩薩三聚淨戒，或是在家，或是出家，先於無上菩提發弘願已，審求功德具足有智有力\n菩薩法師，先禮雙足，偏袒右肩，膝輪據地，合掌恭敬，作如是請："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既請師已，乃徃像前，燒香致敬。或復清眾，為舉香讚。香讚既畢，一心恭敬，向十方三寶，翹勤禮拜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各一禮已，次復𨃰下恭敬，膝輪著地，對佛像前，合掌請師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "請已，專念一境，長養淨心。作是思惟：我今不久當得無盡無量無上功德藏。　爾時，戒師應問言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：已發。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三問答已，次應語言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下歸依、悔過、發願三節，皆應自說。如或不能，師應教授。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爾時，受戒者胡跪如故。戒師起座，對佛像前，普於十方現在三寶，恭敬供養，頂禮合掌，作如是白："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次應復座，為說十重戒相勸持。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受授菩薩，俱起頂禮十方三寶，清眾同稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮三寶畢，受戒菩薩次應禮謝戒師及諸大眾，恭敬而退"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮已，胡跪，添香，捧華，作是唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "散華畢，次復想云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想已，起立唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說已，一叩首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次發誓云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次起唱三自歸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0545001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0545001", "type": "orig", "text": "目錄新作"}
